sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant B as Browser (profile page)
    participant FD as MediaPipe Face Detector (on-device)
    participant UI as UI (Ktor)
    participant S as Service (Ktor)
    participant OS as IObjectStore (S3ObjectStore)
    participant S3 as S3 bucket (private)
    participant DB as MariaDB (profile)

    M->>B: Click camera button
    B->>M: Menu: Take a selfie / Upload a picture / Remove photo
    alt Take a selfie
        M->>B: Take a selfie
        B->>B: getUserMedia front camera, mirrored preview
        B->>FD: Lazy-load model, detect on frames (live guidance)
        M->>B: Capture
    else Upload a picture
        M->>B: Choose file
    end
    B->>M: Crop and zoom (Cropper.js, pre-positioned on face)
    M->>B: Next
    B->>FD: Detect faces on cropped image
    FD-->>B: Boxes, scores, keypoints
    B->>B: Run size, centering, pose, lighting, blur checks
    alt Hard failure
        B->>M: Suggestion and Try again (no override)
    else Soft failure
        B->>M: Suggestion, Try again or Use anyway
    else Pass
        B->>M: Preview and Save photo
    end
    M->>B: Save photo
    B->>UI: POST /profile/@username/photo (512px JPEG)
    UI->>UI: Verify session user is owner, flag enabled
    UI->>S: PUT /members/username/profile-photo
    S->>S: Sniff type, size and dimension checks, re-encode (strips EXIF)
    S->>OS: put profile-photos/username/uuid.jpg
    OS->>S3: PutObject
    S->>DB: Update profile_photo_key, profile_photo_updated_at
    S->>OS: delete previous key (best effort)
    S-->>UI: 200 photoUrl
    UI-->>B: 200 photoUrl
    B->>M: Avatar updates in place

    Note over B,S3: Viewing a photo (streamed through the app, not a redirect)
    B->>UI: GET /avatar/@username
    UI->>S: GET /members/username/profile-photo
    alt Photo exists
        S->>OS: get profile-photos/username/uuid.jpg
        OS->>S3: GetObject
        S3-->>OS: bytes
        OS-->>S: bytes
        S-->>UI: 200 image bytes
        UI-->>B: 200 image bytes (streamed)
    else No uploaded photo
        S-->>UI: 404
        UI-->>B: 302 to Discourse avatar or placeholder SVG
    end
